+## 3. Pas 2: Database
+
+### Statistik
+
+| Metrik                                           | Didokumentasikan    | Aktual                               |
+| ------------------------------------------------ | ------------------- | ------------------------------------ |
+| File skema                                       | 34                  | 43                                   |
+| Tabel dengan `createdBy`/`updatedBy`/`deletedBy` | Semua               | Hanya 2/43 (contracts, invoices)     |
