+#### DB-10 (HIGH) — 6 kolom UUID orphan tanpa deklarasi `.references()`
+
+- **Lokasi:** `customer-profiles.ts:13`, `partner-profiles.ts:26-27`, `companies.ts:14`, `payments.ts:17`, `partner-documents.ts:12`, `corporate-inquiries.ts:15`
